      "css": ".ds-booking{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-1);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);color:var(--color-booked);background:var(--color-booked-bg);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:var(--space-1) var(--space-2);margin-top:var(--space-1)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Карточка без фотографии",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Реальное состояние карточки для желания без изображения.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-gift\"><span class=\"ds-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Без фото: Наушники\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"9\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"m4 18 5-5 3 3 4-5 5 6\"/></svg><span>Без фото</span></span><span class=\"ds-caption\">Наушники</span><span class=\"ds-price\">12 900 ₽</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-gift{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;width:100%;padding:0;border:0;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}.ds-placeholder{border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-content:center;justify-items:center;gap:var(--space-2);width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;background:var(--color-hover);color:var(--color-muted);font-size:var(--text-xs)}.ds-caption{padding-top:var(--space-2);font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading);min-height:calc(var(--text-sm) * var(--leading) * 2)}.ds-price{margin-top:var(--space-1);font-size:var(--text-md);font-weight:var(--weight-regular)}.ds-gift:hover .ds-caption{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:var(--space-1)}.ds-gift:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-focus);outline-offset:3px;}@media(min-width:700px){.ds-caption,.ds-price{font-size:var(--text-lg)}}@media(min-width:1100px){.ds-placeholder{border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;height:calc(var(--space-10) * 8);aspect-ratio:auto}.ds-caption{padding-top:var(--space-5)}.ds-price{font-size:var(--text-xl)}}"
    },
    {
